Task $TASK_ID: $TASK_TITLE

Re-read $RUN_DIR/plan.md now; it is final and may have changed since you checked it. Implement it on this branch ($BRANCH) in this worktree. Run the gate until it passes: $GATE
Commit when done; do not push, and do not rebase onto or merge $BASE: Factory brings the branch up to date itself. Factory tracks and closes bead $TASK_ID. Files under $RUN_DIR/ are ignored by git. Do not change: $(protected_globs "$WT" | tr '\n' ' ')
No skipped tests, suppressed warnings, or swallowed errors; fix things properly.
The human approves, revises or aborts the build in a dialog Factory has you show, or by typing !fy approve, !fy reject '<note>' or !fy abort in another pane, an apostrophe inside the quotes as '\''. Never run these yourself; when the human tells you such a thing in words, tell them which to type.
$MEMORY
Reply with just DONE when finished.
P
}

