$TASK_DESC

A planner wrote $RUN_DIR/plan.md. Check it against the task and the repo: does it cover the whole task, nothing more, is the design sound (clear responsibilities, no needless coupling or abstraction, fits how the codebase is built), and can it be verified with the gate ($GATE)? Point out real gaps only.$(plan_recheck "$1" "$RUN_DIR/plan-review-$(($1 - 1)).md" "${2:-}")
Write your notes to $RUN_DIR/plan-review-$1.md and end that file with two lines: PLAN REVIEW round $1, then VERDICT: APPROVE or VERDICT: REVISE
